    {
      "type": "spotlight",
      "item": "tribalpower:wind_snare",
      "text": [
        "A chest that gathers. The Wind Snare pulls dropped items off the ground around it and keeps them in **27 slots**, so a farm, a Shatter line or a mob pit never leaves a mess behind.",
        "It only lifts items lying loose. It never takes from chests or machines."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How it catches",
      "text": [
        "On every beat, once a second, it scoops up to **8 stacks** lying within **8 blocks**. The catch area is a cube, so it reaches as far up and down as it does sideways.",
        "Each stack costs **2 Pulse** from a generator within 8. No Pulse, no catch; it waits and spends nothing.",
        "Ranking it shortens the beat. Pulse per stack stays 2."
      ]
    },
