      "type": "text",
      "title": "Getting the catch out",
      "text": [
        "Open it like a chest. Hoppers and pipes take from the **bottom** face; the other faces accept items. Crouch and right-click a face with an empty hand to cycle it: Both, Input, Output, Closed.",
        "Sitting on an Ancestral Cache or another Tribal Power store, its bottom face pushes up to **16 items a second** down with no hopper at all.",
        "A comparator reads how full it is: handy for a warning lamp when the snare needs emptying."
